📈 Excel Project: Sales Data Analysis (Profit by City, Quantity & Discount Summary, Top Products)

✅ Client Requirements
The client requested insights based on a large dataset of 9,994 U.S. sales transactions. Specifically, the client asked for:
City-wise Profit
Display profit aggregated by city, sorted in descending order.
State-wise Quantity and Discount Summary
Calculate average quantity sold per state.
Compute total discount provided in each state.
Top 5 Sub-categories by Profit
Identify the most profitable sub-categories of products.

💼 Work Done:
Each client query was resolved with Excel features including pivot tables and structured data analysis:

City-wise Profit
A pivot table was used to aggregate total profit by city.
Data was sorted in descending order to highlight high-performing cities.

